os-Lqno1bhxoiE-unsplash%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb5e1505503c0915f47b_cassie-gallegos-Lqno1bhxoiE-unsplash%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb5e1505503c0915f47b_cassie-gallegos-Lqno1bhxoiE-unsplash%20(1)-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb5e1505503c0915f47b_cassie-gallegos-Lqno1bhxoiE-unsplash%20(1).avif 1920w" class="bt-header-background-image"/></div></header><header data-w-id="27952849-6a42-31ce-1f03-3def432c03c6" class="bt-section-layout-offers"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large"><div class="bt-layout-offers-component"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-xxlarge"><div class="bt-max-width-large"><div class="w-richtext"><p><strong>Locations &amp; Dates:</strong></p><ul role="list"><li><strong>Seminyak (Beach &amp; Nightlife Area)</strong><br/><em>Date:</em> February 10-14, 2024 (4 nights)<br/><em>Hotel:</em> Alila Seminyak Resort</li><li><strong>Ubud (Jungle &amp; Culture)</strong><br/><em>Date:</em> February 14-18, 2024 (4 nights)<br/><em>Hotel:</em> Kamandalu Ubud</li></ul><p><strong>Included Services:</strong></p><ul role="list"><li>8 nights&#x27; accommodation with breakfast</li><li>Private transfers: Airport - Seminyak - Ubud - Airport</li><li>Couples&#x27; spa treatment in Ubud</li><li>Sunset dinner by the beach in Seminyak</li><li>24/7 assistance via WhatsApp</li></ul><p><strong>Total Price:</strong> €2200<br/><em>Note: Price is for 2 people and excludes flights.</em></p></div><div class="bt-margin-top margin-medium"><div class="bt-button-group"><a href="/plan-trip" class="bt-button bt-button-secondary w-button">Plan a trip</a></div></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb60ba297e087e04fbe0_magdalena-love-aO-MokzIs6I-unsplash.avif" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_8621fe4f-a34a-29bd-142d-e378fb5b8ee0-37ce6ffd" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 90vw, (max-width: 1919px) 40vw, 592px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb60ba297e087e04fbe0_magdalena-love-aO-MokzIs6I-unsplash-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb60ba297e087e04fbe0_magdalena-love-aO-MokzIs6I-unsplash-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb60ba297e087e04fbe0_magdalena-love-aO-MokzIs6I-unsplash-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce7021/6719eb60ba297e087e04fbe0_magdalena-love-aO-MokzIs6I-unsplash.avif 1920w" class="bt-cms-offer-image"/></div></div></div></div></header><section data-w-id="a39f3df5-56d4-fdf4-23d2-497192533c19" class="bt-section-layout-contact"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large"><div class="w-layout-grid bt-layout-contact-component-grid"><div class="bt-layout-contact-item"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><div class="bt-layout-contact-icon-wrapper"><div class="bt-icon-embed-medium w-embed"><svg width=" 100%" height=" 100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
